WEBVTT

00:02:58.960 --> 00:03:02.901
Pale mashamba ya vizazi kadhaa
yanapochukuliwa na makampuni makubwa ya kilimo,

00:03:02.925 --> 00:03:05.310
jamii zetu zinapata shida kwa namna nyingi.

00:03:05.814 --> 00:03:10.644
Kiwango cha uhalifu wa kutumia nguvu
Marekani vijijini kimepanda kuzidi wastani wa kitaifa

00:03:11.153 --> 00:03:14.752
wakulima watatu kati ya wanne waliohojiwa 
wameathirika moja kwa moja

00:03:14.776 --> 00:03:16.620
na mlipuko wa madawa ya kulevya

00:03:16.644 --> 00:03:19.526
mara nyingi ikifichwa kama ajali,

00:03:19.550 --> 00:03:21.649
kujiua kwa wakulima kunazidi kupanda

00:03:23.971 --> 00:03:28.606
Hatua ya pili: nunua katika masoko ya
wakulima katika eneo lako

00:03:28.630 --> 00:03:30.319
(vicheko)